{{also|setaside}}
==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[set]] [[aside]]|sets aside|setting aside|set aside}}

# {{context|transitive|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[separate]] and [[reserve]] something for a specific [[purpose]].
#: ''Plan to '''set aside''' three or four hours to see the museum.''
# {{context|transitive|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[disagree]] with something and [[reject]] or [[overturn]] it.
# {{context|transitive|idiomatic|lang=en}} To declare something [[invalid]] or [[null and void]].

